OL,3,GNEWSAM2 northbound partially reopened
OL,4,Aafter lorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M2 northbound has been reopened,
OL,7,Fhowever due to a lorry fire close to
OL,8,FGlengormley it is still down to two
OL,9,Flanes between Greencastle and
OL,10,FSandyknowes roundabout.
OL,12,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService said they received a call about
OL,14,Fthe lorry fire at 15:58 GMT on
OL,15,FWednesday. Three appliances were in
OL,16,Fattendance.
OL,18,FOngoing long delays leaving Belfast are
OL,19,Fexpected
OL,21,FPolice added that road users should
OL,22,Fseek an alternative route, if possible.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
